"A WooCommerce key opens the whole store — orders, products, customers — not "
"just tracking. Your link above reaches TrackShip and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"En WooCommerce-nøkkel åpner hele nettbutikken – bestillinger, produkter, "
"kunder – ikke bare sporing. Lenken din ovenfor når TrackShip og ingenting "
"annet."

